SUMMARY:AI Agents That Know Your Business (Option 1)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nWhat if your AI agents actually und
 erstood your business? Trusted data\, governed semantics\, and business co
 ntext can turn generic AI into experiences grounded in the way your organi
 zation really works. The result: answers and insights that are more releva
 nt\, more useful\, and ready to put to work.\n\n📌 This event is part of
  a series. Learn more here:\nhttps://aka.ms/DataDays/FabConRecap/y\nhttps:
 //aka.ms/DataDays/IntoCerts/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/UnderstandIt/y\nhtt
 ps://aka.ms/AIatWork/BuildIt/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/ShowIt/y\n\n[event
 ID:27688]
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3170
 79155/
