SUMMARY:Advanced Extensibility Patterns with WorkIQ Developer Tools
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nGo beyond the basics and explore ad
 vanced extensibility patterns with WorkIQ Developer Tools\, from enterpris
 e integrations and grounding to actions and orchestration approaches for r
 icher Copilot experiences.\n\nSee how the patterns introduced throughout t
 he series can be applied to real development scenarios\, with WIQD resourc
 es and cookbook recipes available as practical references when you’re re
 ady to build.\n\nGet started: https://microsoft.github.io/wiqd\n\nPractica
 l guide: https://aka.ms/wiqd/cookbooks
