SUMMARY:From Insight to “What If?”: Planning in Microsoft Fabric (Opti
 on 1)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nKnowing what happened is just the b
 eginning. With Planning in Microsoft Fabric\, turn insights into forecasts
 \, scenarios\, and plans that help answer the bigger question: what if? Br
 ing data\, analytics\, planning\, and AI together so teams can look ahead\
 , test possibilities\, and make smarter decisions about what comes next.\n
 \n📌 This event is part of a series. Learn more here:\nhttps://aka.ms/Da
 taDays/FabConRecap/y\nhttps://aka.ms/DataDays/IntoCerts/y\nhttps://aka.ms/
 AIatWork/UnderstandIt/y\nhttps://aka.ms/AIatWork/BuildIt/y\nhttps://aka.ms
 /AIatWork/ShowIt/y\n\n[eventID:27708]
