DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThe conference kicks off with the o
 fficial release of .NET 11!\n\nJoin the .NET and Visual Studio product tea
 m members as they unveil new features and enhancements\, including C# 15\,
  performance improvements\, ASP.NET Core updates\, Blazor enhancements\, .
 NET MAUI\, Aspire\, and AI-powered development.\n\nYou’ll also get deep 
 dives into Visual Studio including new productivity features\, debugging e
 nhancements\, and Copilot
